== Effects ==
* Rerolls all pedestal items in a room by subtracting their internal ID number by one until a valid item is rolled. This effect occurs per item and is independent of any other items in the room.
** Unlockable items will be skipped if they are not unlocked.

== Notes ==
* A list of items sorted by item ID can be found [[Collection_Page_(Repentance)|here]] (helpful for finding Spindown targets at a glance.)
* Hidden items <ref>Hidden items are defined with the attribute <code>hidden="true"</code> in <code>items.xml</code>.</ref> will always be skipped, including:
** {{i|Recall}}
** {{i|Hold}}
** The passive version of {{i|Damocles}} created by usage of Damocles (the one with item ID "<code>656</code>").
** The passive version of {{i|The Book of Belial}} created by {{i|Birthright}} effect of {{c|Judas}} / {{c|Black Judas}} (the one with item ID "<code>59</code>").
* Items created by using Spindown Dice are not considered "normally generated" and can be encountered again in their normal pools if they were not picked up.
* Spindown Dice ignores all effects that prevent certain items from spawning, such as through [[item quality]] thresholds (e.g. {{i|Sacred Orb}}), [[Item Tags]] or other effects such as from {{t|NO!}}.
** This makes the item especially valuable for {{c|Tainted Lost}}, as many helpful items cannot naturally spawn for him otherwise.
* If used in a [[Challenge]] or [[Daily Challenge]], Spindown Dice will skip over items with the "<code>[[Item Tags nochallenge|nochallenge]]</code>" and "<code>[[Item Tags nodaily|nodaily]]</code>" tags, respectively.

